  "body": "The post-merge batch gate failed on `d94c65fcfb9810036bfbe86bd18467b9d20f64a9`.\n\nRun: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/45872054981\n\nFailing steps:\n```\n  FAIL     1s  motion suites: finish3d_hop_height  failed: tests/finish3d_hop_height.rs [tests: a_retract_above_the_part_hops_clean, a_retract_below_the_high_run_never_takes_the_tool_into_the_part, inside_first_on_a_convex_part_with_a_low_retract_never_digs_in]\n```\n\nEach push to main has its own run, so this run gates exactly this commit. If the run of the commit before it is green, this commit broke main. Fix it in the normal order; this issue closes itself on the next green run.\n\n<!-- post-merge-last-sha: 903e420b3a6443330233d3e58386d84100a21c5e -->",
